      "x": 1620,
      "y": 465,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "### Synthesis: Metric vs. Mesh\nSymmetric shapes (sphere, torus, paraboloid) yield exact PDEs via $g_{ij}$, $b_{ij}$, and $\\Gamma^k_{ij}$. Free-form shells (Morpheus) switch to Cartesian FEM + principal stress lines."
    },
